        "lingua_originale": "en",
        "titolo_orig": "US: Supreme Court weakens voting rigths act",
        "testo_it": "Corte Suprema USA indebolisce il Voting Rights Act.",
        "priorita": "Alta",
        "id_gruppo": 10,
        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/us-supreme-court-weakens-voting-rigths-act",
        "orario": "11:29",
        "timestamp": 1777541349,
        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. US: Supreme Court weakens voting rigths act Americas Issued on: 30/04/2026 - 11:29 The Supreme Court of the United States struck down a majority-Black congressional district in Louisiana, ruling it relied too heavily on race and weakening protections under Voting Rights Act of 1965. The 6–3 decision, driven by the court’s conservative majority, is expected to make it harder for minority communities to challenge discriminatory maps, with critics warning it could reduce representation and benefit Republicans in future elections. FRANCE 24's international affairs editor Kethevane Gorjestani has more as midterm elections are approaching. Putin, in call with Trump, put forward ideas on Iran, Kremlin says 29/04/2026 Americas United States: Limited-edition Trump passport unveiled 🇺🇸 29/04/2026 Americas King Charles’s US visit ‘about future generations, not just the current administration’ 29/04/2026 UK King Charles III in the US : 'If it wasn't for us, you'd be speaking French' 29/04/2026 Americas US 'used to' school shootings: Gun violence 'inevitably turned to the political arena as well' 27/04/2026 Americas UK, EU 'push back strongly' on US foreign policy: Will Charles' visit 'soften' transatlantic divide? 27/04/2026 Americas Trump turns assassination attempts into 'political rocket fuel' 26/04/2026 Americas Bus blast in Colombia kills 13 amid rising violence 26/04/2026 Americas What we know about the suspect in White House press dinner shooting 26/04/2026 Americas"
